back out there again,

00:12:22.580 --> 00:12:25.770
people would rally, rally
to the flag as it were.

00:12:25.770 --> 00:12:27.570
So look, I understand it,

00:12:27.570 --> 00:12:30.350
but I think there is a responsibility here

00:12:30.350 --> 00:12:34.710
