American journalists,

00:12:34.710 --> 00:12:37.450
American politicians who are on the center

00:12:37.450 --> 00:12:38.740
right in this country.

00:12:38.740 --> 00:12:42.370
They have a responsibility
to stop do-mongering,

00:12:42.370 --> 00:12:44.157
frankly, to the extent
that many of them are.

00:12:44.157 --> 00:12:47.180
And over course of the
last couple of weeks,

00:12:47.180 --> 00:12:50.420
I've met with a lot of
Congressmen, Congresswomen.

00:12:50.420 --> 00:12:51.740
And they are down.

00:12:51.740 --> 00:12:54.650
You know, they are
depressed, they are down.

00:12:54.650 --> 00:12:56.150
Well if you're depressed and down,

00:12:56.150 --> 00:12:58.510
if you're disillusioned,
if you're defeatist,

00:12:58.510 --> 00:13:01.840
that then becomes a
self-fulfilling prophecy.

00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:04.500
So I would just say to
all these commentators

00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:06.360
and all these elected politicians,

00:13:06.360 --> 00:13:09.050
you know, if you give the appearance

00:13:09.050 --> 00:13:10.310
of being miserable and depressed,

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:13.250
you are letting down not just your party,

00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:15.051
not just the millions of voters,

00:13:15.051 --> 00:13:17.000
you're letting down the country.

00:13:17.000 --> 00:13:18.120
I mean, goodness me.

00:13:18.120 --> 00:13:21.440
You know, Winston Churchill
in the middle of the blitz

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:23.100
when the big cities were being bombed

00:13:23.100 --> 00:13:27.510
night after night for 60 nights,
and what did Churchill do?

00:13:27.510 --> 00:13:30.157
He said, "We will come
through this and move on

00:13:30.157 --> 00:13:32.430
"to the sunlit uplands."

00:13:32.430 --> 00:13:35.900
Even at that darkest of desperate moments

00:13:35.900 --> 00:13:38.260
with thousands being
killed everyday by bombing,

00:13:38.260 --> 00:13:39.800
Churchill offered a vision,

00:13:39.800 --> 00:13:42.360
the shining light on
the hill, the optimism.

00:13:42.360 --> 00:13:43.980
And that's what needs,

00:13:43.980 --> 00:13:46.620
Conservative politicians
need to start doing it.

00:13:46.620 --> 00:13:49.610
And frankly, need to start
doing it very quickly

00:13:49.610 --> 00:13:51.470
because the electoral cycles here,

00:13:51.470 --> 00:13:53.280
well, it's almost unending, isn't it?

00:13:53.280 --> 00:13:56.560
But if you know, if there
are gonna be big successes

00:13:56.560 --> 00:13:59.820
in the midterms, dramatic
successes in the midterms,

00:13:59.820 --> 00:14:02.593
people have gotta get prepared
and start planning right now.

00:14:02.593 --> 00:14:03.680
- When you decided to do this tour,

