were you sorta like, oh man,
I can't believe that the US,

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:08.930
that I'm gonna have to come to the US

00:14:08.930 --> 00:14:10.480
to give a little jolt to this thing?

00:14:10.480 --> 00:14:13.470
I mean, where's the me
