campaign, could upset the odds.

00:14:50.030 --> 00:14:53.440
So I have a huge interest
in what happens here.

00:14:53.440 --> 00:14:55.500
I'd also say this to you.

00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:57.810
You know, we've got Brexit, we're free.

00:14:57.810 --> 00:14:59.260
We're away from this bureaucracy.

00:14:59.260 --> 00:15:01.390
And the signs for the
future of our country

00:15:01.390 --> 00:15:03.970
