00:15:03.970 --> 00:15:05.810
Even the IMF Now thing,

00:15:05.810 --> 00:15:08.790
having told us doom and
disaster would befall us.

00:15:08.790 --> 00:15:10.640
But we're now gonna outperform

00:15:10.640 --> 00:15:12.820
the French and German
economies, all right?

00:15:12.820 --> 00:15:17.770
But you know, the point is
this, the point is this.

00:15:17.770 --> 00:15:22.050
If we with Brexit, if America falls,

00:15:22.050 --> 00:15:25.560
if America falls to hard left socialism,

00:15:25.560 --> 00:15:28.120
you know, and we know that those behind

00:15:28.120 --> 00:15:31.270
