where does that leave
us as Brexit Britain?

00:15:37.210 --> 00:15:38.580
Because the fact is,

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:40.260
the English speaking peoples of the world

00:15:40.260 --> 00:15:42.160
share something extraordinary between us.

00:15:42.160 --> 00:15:44.120
You know, we are all family.

00:15:44.120 --> 00:15:45.340
You know, whether people like that or not,

00:15:45.340 --> 00:15:46.700
but we are all family.

00:15:46.700 --> 00:15:48.860
So I don't want America to fall.

00:15:48.860 --> 00:15:51.260
And I like to think, David,

00:15:51.260 --> 00:15:53.820
that the message I brought in 2016

00:15:53.820 --> 00:15:55.477
did give people a sense of,

00:15:55.477 --> 00:15:57.527
"Wow, these guys have done it.

00:15:57.527 --> 00:15:58.600
"We can do it."

00:15:58.600 --> 00:15:59.470
And I'm trying to come back

00:15:59.470 --> 00:16:01.730
