00:16:16.187 --> 00:16:17.990
"I really needed something positive."

00:16:17.990 --> 00:16:20.297
So I hope, I hope I can do a bit of good.

00:16:20.297 --> 00:16:21.250
- You know, it's interesting.

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:23.320
The kid, I don't know if you
