00:16:42.210 --> 00:16:44.770
That's what I'm trying to do as well.

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:47.360
- Yeah, I mean, the
thing about Brexit was,

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:48.400
you know, it was a long campaign.

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:51.120
It took 27 years of my life.

