00:17:25.830 --> 00:17:27.080
you know for seats,

00:17:27.080 --> 00:17:30.710
they need, they need
their own People's Army.

00:17:30.710 --> 00:17:32.280
And so that's what I'm trying to do.

00:17:32.280 --> 00:17:35.210
And as I say, thus far,
